            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristi Howell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Bought my spices in the bulk section of my local market, doubled the recipe. Ended up with about 3/4 C by volume or 5 oz by weight for a cost of $15.25. Not sure if this is a cost savings or not because I couldn't find prepackaged Garam Masala. Love the complex toasty flavor!",
