            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Elizabeth Duckworth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this same blend from a recipe I got from an Indian Cook Book around 20-25 years ago. I always have these spices on hand and I'm sure I have saved quite a sum of money. I do however keep my blend for up to 4 or 5 months depending on usage. I keep it in a airtight tin and it stays fresh till I have to make it again.",
            "datePublished": "2018-02-27T22:30:20.123Z"
          },
          {
